{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1163529-m20-rage-amnesia-and-living-with-the-consequences-of-your-actions","id":1163529,"title":"[M20] Rage, Amnesia and Living with the Consequences of Your Actions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-29T06:49:42-08:00","id":1163529,"title":"[M20] Rage, Amnesia and Living with the Consequences of Your Actions","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">----------</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":19407,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/19407-miami-ken","user":"Miami-Ken","date":". 11-29-2017, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/19407-miami-ken","name":"Miami-Ken","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-29T07:41:19-08:00","id":1163547,"title":"","content":"It sounds like there's this underlying feeling of 'What Next' in your game. My suggestion is: don't try to answer the question, instead highlight it.<br /> <br /> For instance, perhaps she's attracted the attention of a spirit of Rage and she can occasionally see it watching and waiting for something. It looks like an ominous villain in the background but it's really just confused about what she is. It could become an antagonist, an ally, a familiar, a friend, a foil, really anything as it responds to her actions. The only thing it won't allow her to do is stay an enigma. If it doesn't learn enough by watching it will start trying to provoke responses just so it can see what happens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"u